      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ウチは変わった奴が多くてね。個人個人で\nそれぞれ好きなことをやってて、交流がなくってさ、\n団結力？　ってのが足りない気がするんだよ。\n宴を開いてみんなの心を1つにしたい。よろしくな。",
        "official_en": "We've got a lot of aloof people here—they all stick to\nthemselves and don't socialize. It feels like there's a\nlack of—how to put it—unity? I want to hold a\nbanquet to bring us all together, and I need a dancer!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
