      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "実は踊り手を呼ぶといいって占ってくれた奴がいて、\nそいつの言うとおりだったよ。盛り上がったな！\n楽しみ方も変わってたけど、いい奴らだったろ？\nまた連中に会いに来てやってくれよ。",
        "official_en": "It was a fortune teller who told me to call in a\ndancer, and she was right on the money! Everyone\nwas a little awkward, sure, but the banquet was still\na great time. Please visit again soon!",
        "real_en": null
      },
